            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "If the expected behaviour is correct, the [`apply_palette`](/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/6402c79d73c07ad19374dc7b4f9d4bdfc2f57f42/lua/mini/base16.lua#L429) function could include the line\r\n```lua\r\nhi('@variable', {fg=p.base05, bg=nil, attr=nil, sp=nil})\r\n```\r\nto fix it, but I'm skeptical of this solution as it's the only highlight that uses a capture group.",
