        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "> Although doable, `hi! link @variable Normal` won't work universally, unfortunately, because it will also add the `guibg` color which will override other background color (like from cursor line).\r\n\r\nAhhhh, I didn't notice that until you mentioned it! Yeah, looks like the hl link isn't a proper fix. Fine tuning the highlight groups sounds like a neat feature, I'm interested to see what you end up doing!\r\n\r\nI understand why you would want to keep complexity down and preserve backwards compatibility, so I am perfectly happy to stick with my workaround. I like the added contrast of yellow variables before the treesitter update changed them to orange :) \r\n\r\nI appreciate the work you've put into these modules and your fast responses to issues!",
