            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Yes, this behavior is indeed due to changed default link of variables in 'nvim-treesitter' and Neovim itself.\r\n\r\nI think I'll leave default links for tree-sitter highlight groups in favor of allowing users to choose highlighting they want (and modify it with `highlight` or `highlight link` commands.\r\n\r\nThanks for noticing and bringing attention to this!",
